              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Branch.io Live API Key used for deep linking and attribution APIs.\nAn attacker with this credential, combined with the branch secret,\ncan access link data, modify deep linking configurations, and\nretrieve analytics data via the Branch API.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://help.branch.io/developers-hub/docs/deep-linking-api"
            },
            {
              "id": "np.branchio.2",
              "name": "Branch.io Test Key",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Branch.io Test API Key used for testing deep linking and attribution APIs.\nWhile test keys have limited scope, an attacker could use this to\nunderstand app configurations and deep linking setups.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://help.branch.io/developers-hub/docs/deep-linking-api"
            },
            {
              "id": "np.browserstack.1",
              "name": "BrowserStack Access Key",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BrowserStack Access Key used for automated browser testing APIs.\nAn attacker with this credential, combined with a username, can\nrun automated tests, access test results and screenshots, and\nconsume testing minutes via the BrowserStack Automate API.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.browserstack.com/docs/automate/api-reference/selenium/introduction"
            },
            {
              "id": "np.calendly.1",
              "name": "Calendly Personal Access Token",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Calendly Personal Access Token (v2 API) in JWT format used to access\nscheduling and event data. An attacker with this credential can read\nscheduled events, access invitee information, modify scheduling settings,\nand cancel or create events on behalf of the account owner.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://developer.calendly.com/how-to-authenticate-with-personal-access-tokens"
            },
            {
              "id": "np.ccn.1",
              "name": "Credit Card Number (Visa)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Visa credit card number (starts with 4, 16 digits). Test/placeholder card numbers\nare filtered out. This finding indicates potential credit card number exposure that may require\nreview under PCI DSS or data protection regulations.\n"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "np.ccn.2",
              "name": "Credit Card Number (Mastercard)",
