              "name": "Credentials in .NET System.Net.NetworkCredential",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A .NET `System.Net.NetworkCredential` value with hardcoded parameters was found. This may allow an attack access to a resource that uses basic, digest, NTLM, or Kerberos authentication.\n"
