              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A Slack Workflow Webhook URL was found. These URLs are used by Workflow Builder automations to trigger multi-step workflows. An attacker with this URL can invoke the workflow and potentially exfiltrate data, send messages, or trigger other automated actions without authentication.\n"
