              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A Slack Trigger URL was found. These URLs invoke custom automation functions with app-level permissions using Slack's next-generation automation platform. An attacker with this URL can trigger arbitrary custom functions, potentially exfiltrating data or performing privileged actions within the workspace without requiring user authentication.\n"
